@startuml DFD_Level2_P7
title **LEVEL 2 — Process 7: Generate Reports**

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam arrowColor #1F2937
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2
skinparam arrowFontSize 8

skinparam rectangle<<ent>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam rectangle<<proc>> {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 12
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 10
}
skinparam rectangle<<ds>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontSize 9
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "School\nAdmin" as ADM <<ent>>

rectangle "7.1\nReceive Filter\nParameters\n(Date, Teacher, Bus)" as P71 <<proc>>
rectangle "7.2\nRetrieve Geofence\nViolations"                   as P72 <<proc>>
rectangle "7.3\nRetrieve Trip &\nAttendance Data"                as P73 <<proc>>
rectangle "7.4\nCompile\nReport Data"                            as P74 <<proc>>
rectangle "7.5\nGenerate\nPDF Export"                            as P75 <<proc>>

rectangle "D1  |  Trip Details"          as D1 <<ds>>
rectangle "D3  |  Attendance Records"    as D3 <<ds>>
rectangle "D5  |  SOS & Geofence Alerts" as D5 <<ds>>
rectangle "D7  |  Reports Log"           as D7 <<ds>>

ADM --> P71 : filter parameters\n(date range, teacher, bus number)
ADM --> P71 : selected checkboxes\n(violations, trips)
P71 --> P72 : filter criteria
P71 --> P73 : filter criteria
D5  --> P72 : geofence violations\n(student name, bus, time)
D1  --> P73 : trip details\n(route, stops, status)
D3  --> P73 : attendance records
P72 --> P74 : violation data
P73 --> P74 : trip & attendance data
P74 --> P75 : compiled report data
P75 --> ADM : PDF report
P75 --> D7  : report record

@enduml
